Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: keep SM-G955N playback and capture independent

Use separate coherent rings and PCM state for RDMA0 and WDMA1. Keep
their shared ABOX system power state until the last prepared stream
is closed. Preserve the DMA ring on an engine stop timeout.

diff --git a/sound/soc/samsung/g955n-abox-speaker.c b/sound/soc/samsung/g955n-abox-speaker.c
--- a/sound/soc/samsung/g955n-abox-speaker.c
+++ b/sound/soc/samsung/g955n-abox-speaker.c
@@ -13,6 +13,7 @@
